{
  "about": "At a Group's end, the mouse says whether a column goes inside it or out; between two of its columns, it is in the Group whatever it says. A Pane taken out of a Group's column beside it stays in it, and a column alone of its Group keeps it wherever it goes; one moved away from the rest leaves it.",
